{# The copy text of a thread (AgentCommandTarget): for each message of
   `messages`, its role line `message.heading`, then each text of
   `message.texts` on a line of its own. A blank line separates two messages.
   The role lines are catalog text of the model, so the template has no word
   of its own. #}
{%- for message in messages %}{% if not forloop.first %}

{% endif %}{{ message.heading }}{% for text in message.texts %}
{{ text }}{% endfor %}{% endfor -%}
